<BaseLayout title="Contact Us" articleSchema={true} datePublished="2026-01-15" dateModified="2026-08-19" description="Contact the Acupressure Guide team. Send questions, feedback, or topic suggestions. We read every message and respond within a few business days." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Contact", href: "/contact/" }]} schema={{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ContactPoint","contactType":"customer support","email":"hello@acupressured.com","url":"https://www.acupressured.com/contact/","availableLanguage":"English"}}>
<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 lg:px-6"><h1 class="mb-4">Contact</h1><p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg mb-8">Have a question, suggestion, or feedback? We'd love to hear from you. Reach out at <a href="mailto:hello@acupressured.com" class="text-forest-600 dark:text-forest-300 hover:underline font-medium">hello@acupressured.com</a>.</p>

<section id="what-we-can-help-with" class="mb-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-3">What Can We Help You With?</h2><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">We are happy to hear from you about four things: acupressure technique questions, requests for more detail on existing guides, corrections when you spot an error, and general feedback about the site. Suggestions for new topics are especially welcome — reader questions often become future guides.</p><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">What to include in your email</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300"><li>The page URL or title you have a question about</li><li>Your question or suggestion, with as much detail as you like</li><li>Relevant context, such as the point or technique you were using</li></ul><blockquote class="border-l-4 border-forest-500 pl-4 italic text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 mt-4"><p>"Traditional medicine has been used for thousands of years and continues to meet the needs of many people around the world. The WHO recognizes the importance of traditional, complementary, and integrative medicine."</p><cite class="not-italic text-xs text-stone-500">— World Health Organization, Traditional Medicine Strategy 2014-2023. <a href="https://www.who.int/health-topics/traditional-complementary-and-integrative-medicine" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="text-forest-600 underline hover:text-forest-500">WHO.int</a></cite></blockquote></section>

<section id="response-times" class="mb-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-3">How Quickly Do We Respond?</h2><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">We aim to reply within a few business days. At busier times it may take a little longer, and because we are a small team, we cannot guarantee a response to every message. If your matter is urgent, please allow extra time or seek professional help.</p></section>

<section id="faq" class="mb-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-3">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="space-y-4"><details class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900"><summary class="font-semibold mb-1 cursor-pointer">Do you provide medical advice?</summary><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mt-1">No. We are not a medical service. Our guides are for education only, and we cannot diagnose conditions or recommend treatments for your specific situation. Please consult a qualified healthcare professional for health concerns.</p></details><details class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900"><summary class="font-semibold mb-1 cursor-pointer">Can I request a topic?</summary><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mt-1">Yes. We regularly turn reader questions into new guides and updates. Send us your suggestion and we will add it to our content roadmap.</p></details><details class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900"><summary class="font-semibold mb-1 cursor-pointer">Do you accept partnerships or press inquiries?</summary><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mt-1">Yes. For partnerships, collaborations, or press questions, please email us with a short description of your request and we will do our best to get back to you.</p></details></div></section>

<hr class="my-8 border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700"><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">If you have a medical question, please consult a qualified healthcare professional. We cannot provide individual health advice.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>